<title>USA: Fountain Oil calls for warrant redemption.</title>
<headline>Fountain Oil calls for warrant redemption.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fountain Oil Inc said Tuesday it called for redemption of 1,139,800 stock purchase warrants expiring February 28, 1997, entitling holders to purchase shares of its common stock at $5.10 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it has fixed October 4 as the date on which it will redeem and acquire all of the warrants then remaining outstanding and unexercised for a redemption price of $0.01 each.</p>
</text>
